      "created_at": "2026-07-02T04:31:16.572Z",
      "text": "Reserve Bank of NZ\n@ReserveBankofNZ\nMay 24, 2023\nThe Monetary Policy Committee today voted to raise the Official Cash Rate (OCR) from 5.25% to 5.50% to ensure that consumer price inflation returns to the 1-3% annual target range, while supporting maximum sustainable employment.\nbit.ly/3Mzcaxj",
      "account": "ReserveBankofNZ",
      "media": [],
