      "url": "https://x.com/ReserveBankofNZ/status/1402475447015804929",
      "canonical_url": "https://x.com/ReserveBankofNZ/status/1402475447015804929",
      "created_at": "2026-07-02T04:31:16.572Z",
      "text": "Reserve Bank of NZ\n@ReserveBankofNZ\nJun 9, 2021\nGreat to see the @ClimateCommNZ's final advice to Government released today. A climate-resilient future for Aotearoa New Zealand is possible, and the mahi must start now.",
      "account": "ReserveBankofNZ",
      "media": [],
