    {
      "post_id": "1402416510778298370",
      "url": "https://x.com/ClimateCommNZ/status/1402416510778298370",
      "canonical_url": "https://x.com/ClimateCommNZ/status/1402416510778298370",
      "created_at": "2026-07-02T04:31:16.572Z",
      "text": "Climate Change Commission\n@ClimateCommNZ\nJun 9, 2021\nIt’s live! Ināia tonu nei, our advice to government on climate action, has been tabled and is now available on our website: bit.ly/3w9r97q\nThis report is the first of its kind for Aotearoa. Net zero Aotearoa - the time is now!",
