      "text": "Reserve Bank of NZ\n@ReserveBankofNZ\nApr 5, 2023\nThe Monetary Policy Committee today increased the Official Cash Rate (OCR) by 50 basis points, from 4.75% to 5.25% to return inflation to the 1-3% target range over the medium term. bit.ly/3ZM6ZOS",
