      "created_at": "2026-07-02T04:31:16.572Z",
      "text": "Reserve Bank of NZ\n@ReserveBankofNZ\nAug 18, 2021\nThe current stimulatory level of monetary settings will be retained, keeping the Official Cash Rate (OCR) at 0.25% for now. Today’s decision was made in the context of the Government’s imposition of Level 4 COVID restrictions on activity across NZ bit.ly/2UscOpf #rbnz",
