      "text": "Reserve Bank of NZ\n@ReserveBankofNZ\nApr 13, 2022\nOur Monetary Policy Committee has increased the Official Cash Rate (OCR) to 1.50 percent to maintain price stability and support maximum sustainable employment. Read more: bit.ly/37jxupE\n#RBNZ #OCR",
