      "created_at": "2026-07-02T04:31:16.572Z",
      "text": "Reserve Bank of NZ\n@ReserveBankofNZ\nApr 16, 2024\nWe’re looking at introducing a new payment option for New Zealanders – Digital Cash - an electronic version of cash, that would sit alongside but not replace physical cash. Learn more in the video and have your say here: bit.ly/3UlLZy3",
